OL,3,GNEWSA'Too small' flats planned for
OL,4,Aempty store refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create eight apartments on the
OL,7,Fsite of a vacant town centre department
OL,8,Fstore have been refused.
OL,10,FThe building, next to The Livery pub on
OL,11,Fon Redcar High Street, once housed a
OL,12,Fbranch of Uptons which closed more than
OL,13,F25 years ago.
OL,15,FSo-called prior approval was sought to
OL,16,Fconvert the first and second floors
OL,17,Finto eight flats, with a separate
OL,18,Fentrance on the ground floor.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
