OL,3,GNEWSA'Too small' flats planned for
OL,4,Aempty store refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Redcar and Cleveland Council
OL,7,Frecords show the change of use
OL,8,Fapplication from retail space was
OL,9,Frefused in July, partially on the
OL,10,Fgrounds that the proposed development
OL,11,Fdid not meet minimum national space
OL,12,Frequirements.
